@startuml
title Subfigure: #16 同名 target 两轮覆盖对比

state "Round 1\nsetup $r0='v1'" as r1
state "After Round 1\n$r1='v1'" as ar1
state "Round 2\n$r0='v2'" as r2
state "After Round 2\n$r1='v2'" as ar2

r1 --> ar1 : executeMove($r0=v1 → $r1)
ar1 --> r2 : set('$r0', 'v2')
r2 --> ar2 : executeMove($r0=v2 → $r1)\n↑ 写入覆盖旧值

note right of ar2
  **核心断言**
  internalStore.get('$r1')
    === 'v2' ✓
  验证覆盖语义而非追加
  （不保留 v1 副本）
end note

note left of r1
  初始：$r0='v1'
  $r1 未设置
end note

@enduml
